{
  "about": "Vectors for keeping an estate recoverable (DEC-0107), written by tools/vectors/hub-move.ts, never by hand. Absent values are absent members. silence: hubSilence(heartbeatAt, at), heartbeatAt the at of the heartbeat a machine holds; speaking up to 24 hours, silent past it up to 72, stale past 72; sinceSeconds floored, never below zero. recovery: recoveryReady(record), ready with two passkeys or more by distinct credentialId that the record does not revoke. move: hubMove(parent, next), added and removed by machine, kid and public x (reported by machine and kid) in the order the record lists machines, a machine listed twice read by its first entry, revoked when next lists the removed kid as a hub-key revocation; a removed key not revoked is a revision FAC-SEM-114 refuses (DEC-0084). anchor: anchorDelta(state, record) over the committed entries of fixtures/vectors/revocation-delta.json; a record that lists every dropped entry's revocation by kind and ref; missing names the dropped entries' sequences. Every case holds in every time zone.",
